graph LR
    subgraph User Code
        V1[Alloc: [i32; 1000]]
        V2[Local math loop]
        V3[Volatile write to hardware port]
        V4[Print error message to stdout]
        V5[Unused intermediate string alloc]
    end

    subgraph Observability Filter
        V1 -->|No trace dependencies| Eliminated[ELIMINATED]
        V2 -->|Folded into constant expression| ClosedForm[REDUCED TO CONSTANT]
        V3 -->|Crosses hardware interface| Kept[PRESERVED IN MACHINE CODE]
        V4 -->|Crosses standard I/O| Kept
        V5 -->|No side effects| Eliminated
    end

    subgraph Target Output
        Kept --> Assembly[Emit Assembly Instruction]
        ClosedForm --> Assembly
    end

    style Eliminated fill:#f44,stroke:#d32,color:#fff
    style ClosedForm fill:#ff9800,stroke:#f57c00,color:#fff
    style Kept fill:#4CA,stroke:#388,color:#fff
